GXO was the first company to put Digit to work. Now it’s expanding to two more U.S. warehouses, starting in early 2027.

@johnkoetsier @Forbes covers why repeat customers are the signal that matters in humanoid robotics:
https://t.co/wCO9VEwTLd https://t.co/AtMntJVAY5

