A new step for Agility Digit 5. 🤖

@agilityrobotics is adopting NVIDIA Thor to simplify onboard compute and building on its NVIDIA Halos for Robotics collaboration, bringing compute and safety development together as it prepares for commercial scale. 

Learn more: https://t.co/MrDquFlSpg

